---
globs: frontend/src/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use functional React components. Colocate styles next to the component (`login.css`, `register.css`).
- Put HTTP clients in `frontend/src/core/api/`, shared types in `frontend/src/core/types/`, and auth helpers in `frontend/src/services/`.
- New UI belongs under `frontend/src/components/` or the matching app folder (`apps/resume-builder`, `apps/cover-letter`, `website`).
- Prefer existing API helpers over ad-hoc `fetch` in components. See @frontend/src/core/api/index.ts
